		"viz_info_panel": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"markdown": "# Metric reference — Executive dashboard\n\n---\n\n## IT health\n\nThree direct indicators from Cisco Catalyst Center.\n\n- **Network health** — Latest `healthScore` from `cisco:dnac:networkhealth` (0–100)\n- **Device health** — % of devices that are Reachable + Managed (0–100)\n- **Open issues** — Count of active issues (P1–P4) from `cisco:dnac:issue`\n\n---\n\n## User experience\n\nClient connectivity and path health.\n\n- **Client health** — Latest `scoreValue` from `cisco:dnac:clienthealth` for all client types (0–100)\n- **Active clients** — Distinct MAC addresses from `cisco:dnac:client` (wired + wireless)\n- **ThousandEyes** — Composite of network loss/latency, HTTP availability, and page-load completion\n\n---\n\n## Security\n\nFirewall and authentication posture.\n\n- **FW blocked** — Blocked connection count from the Network_Traffic data model\n- **Threat sources** — Distinct source IPs with blocked connections at the firewall\n- **Failed auth** — Distinct user accounts with failed authentication from the Authentication data model\n\n---\n\n## Building resilience\n\nSpaces occupancy and device activity.\n\n- **Active devices** — Latest `activeDevicesCount` per location from Cisco Spaces DEVICE_PRESENCE events\n- **Wi-Fi clients** — Distinct associated MACs from Cisco Spaces DEVICE_ASSOCIATION events\n- **Occupancy** — % of rooms with `peoplePresence=true` from Cisco Spaces\n\n---\n\n## Drilldowns\n\nClick any domain card title or the **Open** link to navigate to the full operational dashboard for that domain."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_narr_exec_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "At-a-glance operational posture across **all Cisco platforms** — network health, security threats, user experience, and building performance. Click any domain card to drill down."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
